THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This project is a derivative work that builds on two upstream projects and
includes assets from one of them:

- kiro-buddy by Jagatees — https://github.com/Jagatees/kiro-buddy
  Provides the status system, sprite animations, and Kiro hook integration.
  Sprite assets under assets/pet/ originate from this project.

- Lockpaw by sorkila (Erik Nielsen) — https://github.com/sorkila/lockpaw
  Provides the screen-guard design and lock state-machine concept (rebuilt
  here for Windows/Electron).

The license terms of these upstream projects are NOT reproduced here and have
not been independently verified in this file. Before redistributing this
project or its bundled assets, review each upstream project's LICENSE and
comply with its terms. If an upstream license requires attribution or license
inclusion, add the corresponding NOTICE/LICENSE text to this repository.
